msgid ""
"The *Stratosnapper* with its inputs/outputs is shown below. The servo inputs"
" can be push-buttons, sticks, two or three-way switches, etc. These are "
"configured using a GUI configuration utility from your PC via USB."
msgstr ""
"*Stratosnapper* 的输入/输出如下图所示。舵机输入可以是按钮、摇杆、两档或三档拨杆等，通过 PC 端 USB 连接的 GUI "
"配置工具进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:52
#: 02f97a0bb87d4d049033c280e2b2ee8a 1692f909ed554b05b1be2e5677f52509
#: 45e47f8bd1f341bb853e5d34b859729e 83e264a6ce4a46ba837a1520dcfdd6c4
#: a442c7e9004e46e4ba29a1a1684d5f3b
msgid ""
"Note the two servo leads are connected on the input side of *Stratosnapper*;"
" one of these is to power the IR module."
msgstr "请注意，两根舵机线连接在 *Stratosnapper* 的输入侧；其中一根用于为红外模块供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:57
#: 07d2a9652e77418e8d244dc3519d9a52 9d75ea9752684273a34944f156909dca
#: ca0a0591020e4f72b33f97e496fdc323 cab56e0e4b3342f78483884bb0cebe8a
#: def38e941b1c4e238787ab700948c515
msgid ""
"It is not possible to power the IR module (or any other device) from the "
"Pixhawk AUX ports. You must either power provide a separate BEC to power the"
" IR device or power the Pixhawk outputs rail with a BEC and power the device"
" off that."
msgstr ""
"无法从 Pixhawk AUX 端口为红外模块（或任何其他设备）供电。您必须提供独立 BEC 为红外设备供电，或通过 BEC 为 Pixhawk "
"输出轨供电并从该轨道为设备供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-stratosnapperv2.rst:62
